  "body": "   a quadrilateral whose sides are labeled (W), (3.8*W), (4*H), (23*H), (29*W), and (87*H).        The perimeter is the result from adding the six sides together: There are two -terms and two -terms. We combine each pair of like terms and the perimeter is      "
