  "body": "  Find the slope-intercept form of the equation of the line that passes through the points and        First find the slope through our points: and   So far we have Now we need to solve for since neither of the points given were the vertical intercept. Recall that to do this, we will choose one of the two points and plug it into our equation. We choose   Lastly, we write our equation.       "
