  "body": " Adding\/Subtracting with Fractions Having the Same Denominator  addition of fractions with the same denominator   To add or subtract two fractions having the same denominator, keep that denominator, and add or subtract the numerators. If it's possible, useful, or required of you, simplify the result by reducing to lowest terms.   "
