  "number": "A.6.4.35",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  Imagine making up a number with the following pattern. After the decimal point, write the natural numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, etc. The decimal digits will extend forever with this pattern:  Is the number a rational number or an irrational number?       The number is irrational. The decimal will never end and it will never repeat.      "
